---
import { PLATFORM_NAME } from "astro:env/client";
import Link from "#src/components/Link.astro";
import Prohibited from "#src/components/Prohibited.astro";
import Strong from "#src/components/Strong.astro";
import Ul from "#src/components/Ul.astro";
import ArticleLayout from "#src/layouts/ArticleLayout.astro";
---

<ArticleLayout title="Terms of Service">
  <h1 class="text-center text-3xl">Terms of Service</h1>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
  <p class="mbs-3 text-zinc-400">
    By creating an account on <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong>, you agree to these terms. <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> has the right to
    suspend any account or profile that violates these rules. Check the{" "}
    <Link href="/i/privacy" rel="privacy-policy">
      {" "}
      privacy policy{" "}
    </Link>{" "}
    for more information about how your data is handled.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">2. User Responsibilities</h2>
  <p class="mbs-3 text-zinc-400">
    Users are responsible for the content they publish on their profiles. Users must not publish content that is illegal, offensive, or
    violates the rights of others. <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> is not directed at anyone under the age of 16.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">3. Prohibited Content and Conduct</h2>
  <p class="mbs-3 text-zinc-400">
    You may not use <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> for any illegal purposes. Prohibited content includes, but is not limited to:
  </p>
  <Prohibited class="my-3" />
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    A profile containing this type of content, or linking to it, may be reported (with a notification sent to the profile maintainers for
    possible correction) or even deleted outright, depending on the severity. In the latter case, a prior notification detailing the reason
    will be provided, along with the right to respond where applicable.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">A user can only report the same profile once.</p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    In cases <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> deems severe (including, but not limited to, abuse of the reporting system) the platform
    reserves the right to temporarily suspend a user from using the platform (including account suspension), identified by credentials such
    as their email address. The user will be notified and will have the right to appeal.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">4. Platform Role and Liability</h2>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> provides a technical tool for creating profiles. The platform is not responsible for user-generated
    content and users are responsible for compliance with local laws.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    If you use your profile for business (e.g., as a lawyer, or shop), you are responsible for linking your own Legal Notice and complying
    with local consumer laws. <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> is not liable for your failure to provide these disclosures.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">
    This website, <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> platform and user profiles may display links to external websites, whose privacy
    practices <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> is not responsible for. As mentioned in the "Prohibited Content and Conduct" section, a
    profile that contains prohibited content or links to it may be reported or even deleted.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    The platform has the right to add, modify or remove features at any time, including themes and the user interface of profiles.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> reserves the right to permanently discontinue or shut down the service at its sole discretion. In the
    event of a planned permanent shutdown, <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> will provide all registered users with at least 20 days advance
    notice. Users are responsible for exporting any personal data or content within this 20-day window. After closing the service, all
    profiles and user data will be deleted from <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> systems.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    Data is stored and managed using Microsoft Azure's cloud infrastructure, which includes backup and redundancy features. However, in the
    event of a natural disaster or other force majeure event beyond reasonable control, no liability will be held for data loss or service
    unavailability.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">In the event of a significant data loss, the following measures will be taken:</p>
  <Ul>
    <li>Reasonable backup and recovery measures are maintained at all times.</li>
    <li>Affected users and the relevant supervisory authority will be notified.</li>
  </Ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl mbs-6 text-zinc-300">5. Payments and premium services</h2>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">
    <Link href="https://polar.sh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      {" "}
      Polar.sh{" "}
    </Link>{" "}
    will be used as a Merchant of Records for premium subscriptions and payments. By purchasing on <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong>, you may
    also agree to their{" "}
    <Link href="https://polar.sh/legal/checkout-buyer-terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      {" "}
      terms{" "}
    </Link>{" "}
    and{" "}
    <Link href="https://polar.sh/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      {" "}
      privacy policy{" "}
    </Link>
    . Refunds are handled according to their policy:{" "}
    <Link href="https://polar.sh/docs/features/refunds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      https://polar.sh/docs/features/refunds
    </Link>
    .
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> has the right to add, modify and remove premium features, prices and plans; with at least 30 days'
    notice if the changes are material or affect the price. Everything is listed in the <Link href="/i/pricing">pricing</Link> page.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 my-3">
    If a premium profile uses premium features, but the subscription is cancelled, the profile will be downgraded to a free profile, the
    premium features will be removed, and the default settings of the free profile will be applied. For example, a premium profile uses a
    premium theme; after switching to a free profile, the default theme of the free profile will be used.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> reserves the right to set and update the default settings for free profiles.
  </p>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 mbs-3">
    If a premium profile is deleted, the payment order cannot be refunded unless it is within <Strong>Polar.sh</Strong>'s refund period
    (i.e., it was recently paid).
  </p>

  <h2 class="mbs-6 text-2xl text-zinc-300">6. Modifications to Terms</h2>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 mbs-3">
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> reserves the right to modify these Terms at any time. If a revision is material,{" "}
    <Strong>{PLATFORM_NAME}</Strong> will provide at least 30 days' notice prior to any new terms taking effect. What constitutes a material
    change will be determined at {PLATFORM_NAME}'s sole discretion. By continuing to access or use {PLATFORM_NAME}'s Service after those
    revisions become effective, you agree to be bound by the revised terms.
  </p>

  <p class="text-zinc-400 mbs-6">
    For information regarding the governing law and jurisdiction, please refer to the <Link href="/i/legal-notice">Legal Notice</Link> page.
  </p>

  <p class="mbs-6 text-zinc-500">Last updated: April 2026</p>
</ArticleLayout>
